## 🎨 Styling Guidelines

### Tailwind Classes
```tsx
// Layout
className="flex flex-col gap-4 p-6"

// Colors
className="bg-slate-900 text-white border-slate-800"

// Responsive
className="w-full sm:w-1/2 lg:w-1/3"

// States
className="hover:bg-slate-800 active:scale-95 transition-all"

// Rounded
className="rounded-xl" // or rounded-2xl, rounded-3xl
```

### Color Palette
- Primary: `indigo-500`, `indigo-600`
- Success: `emerald-500`, `green-400`
- Warning: `yellow-500`, `amber-400`
- Error: `red-500`, `pink-500`
- Neutral: `slate-900`, `slate-800`, `slate-700`

