## 🔌 API Patterns

### Frontend API Call
```typescript
const response = await fetch('http://localhost:8000/api/v1/endpoint', {
  method: 'POST',
  headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
  body: JSON.stringify(data),
});

if (!response.ok) {
  throw new Error('API call failed');
}

const result = await response.json();
```

### Backend Endpoint
```python
@router.post("/endpoint")
async def endpoint(request: RequestModel) -> dict:
    try:
        # Validate input (automatic with Pydantic)
        # Process data
        result = await process_data(request)
        # Return response
        return {
            "status": "success",
            "data": result
        }
    except ValueError as e:
        raise HTTPException(status_code=400, detail=str(e))
    except Exception as e:
        logger.error(f"Error: {e}")
        raise HTTPException(status_code=500, detail="Internal error")
```

---

## 📊 Database Queries

### Supabase Pattern
```python
# SELECT
result = await supabase.table('memories').select('*').eq('user_id', user_id).execute()

# INSERT
result = await supabase.table('memories').insert(data).execute()

# UPDATE
result = await supabase.table('memories').update(data).eq('id', id).execute()

# DELETE
result = await supabase.table('memories').delete().eq('id', id).execute()
```

---

## 🎯 Component Patterns

### Modal
```tsx
<AnimatePresence>
  {isOpen && (
    <motion.div
      initial={{ opacity: 0 }}
      animate={{ opacity: 1 }}
      exit={{ opacity: 0 }}
      className="fixed inset-0 bg-black/50 z-50"
    >
      {/* Modal content */}
    </motion.div>
  )}
</AnimatePresence>
```

### Card
```tsx
<div className="bg-slate-900/50 rounded-3xl p-6 border border-slate-800 backdrop-blur-sm">
  {/* Content */}
</div>
```

### Button
```tsx
<button className="px-6 py-3 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-all disabled:opacity-50">
  Action
</button>
```

